        <StdOut>=== DELETE Command Analysis ===
Our tool:  80E40000134F09A000000308000010000007B1419E555DE028
GP Pro:    84E40080134F09A000000308000010007547C55C046E221C

Our tool structure:
  CLA: 0x80 (our: secure messaging)
  INS: 0xE4 (DELETE)
  P1:  0x00 (our: delete mode)
  P2:  0x00
  Lc:  0x13 (19 bytes)

GP Pro structure:
